---
import Marketing from "@/layouts/Marketing.astro";
---
<Marketing
  title="About Aptora — the AI resume workspace"
  description="Aptora is an AI document workspace for truthful, high-converting resume tailoring — built by Enally."
  path="/about"
  active="about"
>
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden">
    <div class="grid-bg pointer-events-none absolute inset-0"></div>
    <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-4xl px-5 pt-20 pb-10 text-center lg:pt-28">
      <div class="reveal inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border hairline bg-white px-3.5 py-2 text-xs font-medium text-[#555] shadow-sm">
        <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#16803C]"></span>
        Our story
      </div>
      <h1 class="reveal mt-7 text-4xl font-semibold leading-[1.05] tracking-[-.04em] sm:text-6xl">
        Make your experience<br /><span class="text-[#666]">count.</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="reveal mx-auto mt-6 max-w-2xl text-base leading-7 text-[#666] sm:text-lg">
        The AI document workspace built for truthful, high-converting career applications.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Content -->
  <section class="border-t hairline bg-white">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 py-16 lg:py-24">
      <div class="reveal space-y-10">
        <p class="text-lg leading-8 text-[#333]">
          Aptora was built with a simple conviction: <strong>your experience counts, but how you
          present it matters just as much.</strong> Job seekers face endless ATS filters and vague
          rejections, while recruiters spend under 7 seconds skimming a resume. Aptora bridges this
          gap without compromising integrity.
        </p>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-[-.02em]">Truthful alignment, not fabrication</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-[#555]">
            Most AI resume generators invent achievements or flood documents with hallucinated
            buzzwords. Aptora does the opposite: it operates strictly on the truthful experience you
            already have. It identifies your strongest real-world proof points, aligns terminology
            with the target role, closes keyword blindspots, and compiles real, publication-grade
            LaTeX PDFs that human hiring managers and ATS parsers love.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-[-.02em]">Designed documents, not cookie-cutter layouts</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-[#555]">
            Resume templates shouldn't look like generic web builders. Aptora's rendering engine
            compiles hardened LaTeX directly into clean, typographic single-page or multi-page
            formats. Every margin, font hierarchy, and horizontal rule is balanced for readability
            and visual density.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-[-.02em]">Built by Enally</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-[#555]">
            Aptora is an independent product incubated and engineered by <strong>Enally</strong> —
            building tools, ecosystems, and opportunities for modern developers, engineers, and
            professionals globally.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- CTA -->
      <div class="reveal mt-14 rounded-2xl border hairline bg-[#111] p-8 text-center text-white sm:p-12">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-[-.03em] sm:text-3xl">Ready to tailor your resume?</h2>
        <p class="mx-auto mt-3 max-w-md text-sm leading-6 text-[#aaa]">Bring the resume you already have. Let AI make the strongest version of what's already true.</p>
        <a href="/" class="mt-7 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-white px-5 py-3.5 text-sm font-semibold text-[#111] transition hover:bg-[#ededeb]">
          Start tailoring
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Marketing>
